	(19, 3, 3, 2233, 5, 'A quiet escape by the sea', 'The room was spotless and the sound of the waves made every night feel peaceful. We would happily stay again.', 'published', '2026-11-13 02:00:00', '2026-11-13 02:00:00'),
	(20, 3, 4, 2234, 5, 'Thoughtful details everywhere', 'Everything we needed was already prepared. The bed was comfortable, the space was calm, and the check-in was effortless.', 'published', '2026-11-10 02:00:00', '2026-11-10 02:00:00'),
	(21, 3, 5, 2235, 5, 'Perfect for a slow weekend', 'We loved waking up to the sea breeze and having coffee just steps from the shore. It felt private and restorative.', 'published', '2026-11-07 02:00:00', '2026-11-07 02:00:00'),
	(22, 3, 6, 2236, 5, 'Warm and welcoming stay', 'The team made us feel at home from arrival to checkout. The room was clean, bright, and exactly as described.', 'published', '2026-11-04 02:00:00', '2026-11-04 02:00:00'),
	(23, 3, 7, 2237, 5, 'Better than expected', 'The photos do not do the place justice. It was quiet, spacious, and close to everything we wanted to see.', 'published', '2026-11-01 02:00:00', '2026-11-01 02:00:00'),
	(24, 3, 8, 2238, 5, 'A memorable family stay', 'Our family had plenty of room to relax, and the location made it easy to spend the whole day by the water.', 'published', '2026-10-29 02:00:00', '2026-10-29 02:00:00'),
	(25, 3, 9, 2239, 5, 'Clean, comfortable, and serene', 'The room was beautifully maintained and the surroundings were peaceful. It was the reset we needed.', 'published', '2026-10-26 02:00:00', '2026-10-26 02:00:00'),
